    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "Find the coefficient of $x^3$ in $(x+3)^2(x+1)^5$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$155$.\n\nAdd the coefficient products from the three pairs of terms whose powers sum to $3$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+3)^2&=x^2+6x+9\\\\(x+1)^5&=1+5x+10x^2+10x^3+5x^4+x^5\\end{align*}$$\nThe products contributing to $x^3$ are $x^2(5x)$, $6x(10x^2)$ and $9(10x^3)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Coefficient of }x^3&=1\\times5+6\\times10+9\\times10\\\\\\text{Coefficient of }x^3&=155\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 44
  },
